Description: Meta-package for the curveR immunoassay calibration curve
    ecosystem. Installs and attaches curveRcore (shared model mathematics,
    preprocessing, and output class) and curveRfreq (frequentist NLS
    calibration) as hard dependencies. curveRbayes (Bayesian hierarchical
    calibration via Stan) and curveRweights (continuous precision weighting
    from calibration-curve uncertainty) are available as optional
    Stan-dependent components. Loading curveR emits a startup message
    describing all four packages and the CmdStan installation requirement
    for the Stan-backed components.
URL: https://immunoplex.github.io/curveR/, https://github.com/immunoplex/curveR
